# Layout-verification screenshots. Generated artefacts, not source: `scripts/screenshot.mjs`
# recreates the whole set in one command, and a full-page capture of a long landing page is
# ~1 MB each — several MB of PNG in git history for something reproducible is a bad trade.
#   node scripts/screenshot.mjs <url> --label=<name>
docs/screenshots/
